From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nqtsu91 <55384628+Nqtsu91@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 20:22:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Sukkit WorldGen: remap visuel des biomes custom vers le
 client

Table statique BiomeClientRemap (256 entrees, identite par defaut) appliquee
au tableau de biomes lors de la construction des ChunkMap (point unique :
PacketPlayOutMapChunk.a, utilise par MapChunk, MapChunkBulk et le cache
cacheChunkMaps). Permet aux biomes custom serveur d'apparaitre au client
comme un biome vanilla choisi. Cout nul si aucun mapping enregistre.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/PacketPlayOutMapChunk.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/PacketPlayOutMapChunk.java
index a0021fb96bac484f69e9d7c5c935c034d56358f9..d1efc129177a693ebd1ba3c4c8014d00e32cac86 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/PacketPlayOutMapChunk.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/PacketPlayOutMapChunk.java
@@ -99,7 +99,7 @@ public class PacketPlayOutMapChunk implements Packet<PacketListenerPlayOut> {
         }
 
         if (flag) {
-            a(chunk.getBiomeIndex(), packetplayoutmapchunk_chunkmap.a, j);
+            a(org.bukkit.craftbukkit.worldgen.BiomeClientRemap.remap(chunk.getBiomeIndex()), packetplayoutmapchunk_chunkmap.a, j); // Sukkit - WorldGen: remap visuel des biomes custom
         }
 
         return packetplayoutmapchunk_chunkmap;
diff --git a/src/main/java/org/bukkit/craftbukkit/block/CraftBlock.java b/src/main/java/org/bukkit/craftbukkit/block/CraftBlock.java
index caa7e842cbbe1b666d96a6d3b94fd49fe9bf50f3..17c9dc9d03694372ba5410e44f33eb1de59cd1ed 100644
